{"4247100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Exone Rift", "steam_appid": 4247100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re stranded on a hostile planet. Gather resources, expand your base, and strategically place territory tiles to seize control of every inch of the planet. Build up your defenses, upgrade your technologies, and take direct control of your hero to repel enemy waves and bend the planet to your will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247100/extras/7689387dc56ac86cb967af1d6b756685.poster.avif?t=1786333180\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247100/extras/7689387dc56ac86cb967af1d6b756685.webm?t=1786333180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247100/extras/7689387dc56ac86cb967af1d6b756685.mp4?t=1786333180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategy &amp; Defense:</strong> develop your base, strengthen its defenses, and never let the enemy break through.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tile-Based Territory Expansion:</strong> design the world tile by tile and dominate the entire planet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Direct Character Control:</strong> step into the role of the hero and directly influence combat and resource gathering.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RPG Progression:</strong> upgrade technologies, resource production, and base defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beginner-Friendly:</strong> simple mechanics with deep strategic depth for fans of the genre.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_para